{conv_sml_greet
    {message
        output={@

"Ok.

I see you just left the monorail station, I can tell you about how to
get monorail tickets, if you need a monorail ticket.

Look, I know this city like the back of my hand, I can help you find
whatever you are after - if you have questions about the streets or
where to go, just let me know.

I know its secrets.

I know where all the seedy stuff is too, if you're looking for something...
shady - piracy?"

---

"**You should see a man who is on the cruise ship, he has something for you. To get there -- go west.**"

(To see your current quest use:  stats)

        }
    }
}



// Initial Greeting
{input, syntax=[tplt_syntax]((x_shifty_char))
    {act, logic=conv_sml_greet, tags=!_type|room }

    {logic
        logic={@
            ?[self]((topic)) = 'smalltalk'
            and
            ?[self]((step)) = 'help'
        }
    }
        output={@
The man seems confused.
        }
}
